[en.CHARACTER_UPPER_CRUST_NAME]
Upper Crust

[en.CHARACTER_UPPER_CRUST_DESC]
“The Swanifying Committee”, a small organization that only serves the royal swanifying celebration, had once become synonymous with the absolute power center of the Empire. The three members of the Swanifying Committee, Fancy Pants, Jet Set, and Upper Crust, just happened once to be the three highest leaders of the Empire’s Royal Committee: the Supreme Chairpony, the Chairpony, and the Chief Secretary. But after they had sorted out everything in Canterlot, Jet Set and Upper Crust did not get the long-term power they dreamed of. Their purposes have been surved and their values have been exhausted.
Nevertheless, Upper Crust believes in hope, and Upper Crust believes that she knows the Empress very well —— the one in power but has a childish mind. One day, the “Swanifying Committee” will once again become the center of power.

[zh.CHARACTER_UPPER_CRUST_NAME]
上流

[zh.CHARACTER_UPPER_CRUST_DESC]
“天鹅委员会”，一个仅仅是服务于皇家天鹅庆典的小型组织，却一度成为帝国权力中枢的代名词。花花短裤、奢华、上流这三位天鹅委员会的成员，曾恰好是帝国皇家委员会的三位最高领导者：最高委员长、委员长、和首席秘书长。但在他们把坎特洛特的一切打理的井井有条之后，飞鸟尽良弓藏，奢华和上流并未如愿取得长久的权力。
无论如何，上流相信希望，上流认为自己十分了解那个大权在握却心智幼稚的女皇。总有一天，“天鹅委员会”会再次成为权力的中心。
